on","gloss":"Hebron","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":71},{"base":"H8033","lemma":"שָׁם","tr":"sham","gloss":"there","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":834},{"base":"H5045","lemma":"נֶ֫גֶב","tr":"ne·gev","gloss":"Negeb","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":112}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"NUM","chapter":20,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"In the first month, the whole congregation of Israel entered the Wilderness of Zin and stayed in Kadesh. There Miriam died and was buried.","from":21},{"book":"NUM","chapter":33,"verse":36,"verseEnd":36,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"They set out from Ezion-geber and camped at Kadesh in the Wilderness of Zin.","from":21},{"book":"JDG","chapter":1,"verse":9,"verseEnd":9,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"Afterward, the men of Judah marched down to fight against the Canaanites living in the hill country, in the Negev, and in the foothills.","from":17},{"book":"NUM","chapter":27,"verse":14,"verseEnd":14,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"for when the congregation contended in the Wilderness of Zin, both of you rebelled against My command to show My holiness in their sight regarding the waters.” Those were the waters of Meribah in Kadesh, in the Wilderness of Zin.","from":21},{"book":"DEU","chapter":31,"verse":23,"verseEnd":23,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"Then the LORD commissioned Joshua son of Nun and said, “Be strong and courageous, for you will bring the Israelites into the land that I swore to give them, and I will be with you.”","from":20},{"book":"PSA","chapter":78,"verse":12,"verseEnd":12,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"He worked wonders before their fathers in the land of Egypt, in the region of Zoan.","from":22},{"book":"PSA","chapter":78,"verse":43,"verseEnd":43,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"when He performed His signs in Egypt and His wonders in the fields of Zoan.","from":22},{"book":"GEN","chapter":12,"verse":9,"verseEnd":9,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And Abram journeyed on toward the Negev.","from":17}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"25-29":{"people":[{"id":"aaron-h0175","name":"Aaron","kind":"person","brief":"High Priest","count":1,"firstVerse":26},{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":1,"firstVerse":26},{"id":"moses-h4872","name":"Moses","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Amram","count":1,"firstVerse":26},{"id":"anak-h6061","name":"Anak","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Arba","count":1,"firstVerse":28},{"id":"amorites-h0567","name":"Amorites","kind":"person","brief":"Canaanites","count":1,"firstVerse":29},{"id":"heth-h2845","name":"Heth","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Canaan","count":1,"firstVerse":29},{"id":"jebusites-h2983g","name":"Jebusites","kind":"person","brief":"Canaanite tribe","count":1,"firstVerse":29}],"places":[{"id":"kadesh-h6946g","name":"Kadesh","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":26},{"id":"paran-h6290g","name":"Paran","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":26},{"id":"amalek-h6002g","name":"Amalek","kind":"place","brief":"In Edom","count":1,"firstVerse":29},{"id":"canaan-h3667a","name":"Canaan","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":29},{"id":"jordan-h3383","name":"Jordan","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":29},{"id":"negeb-h5045g","name":"Negeb","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":29}],"words":[{"base":"H3427","lemma":"יָשַׁב","tr":"ya·shav","gloss":"to dwell","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":1079},{"base":"H6529","lemma":"פְּרִי","tr":"pe·ri","gloss":"fruit","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":119},{"base":"H5712","lemma":"עֵדָה","tr":"e·dah","gloss":"congregation","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":149},{"base":"H6061","lemma":"עֲנָק","tr":"a·naq","gloss":"Anak","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":9},{"base":"H1571","lemma":"גַּם","tr":"gam","gloss":"also","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":769},{"base":"H6290","lemma":"פָּארָן","tr":"pa·ran","gloss":"Paran","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":11},{"base":"H3211","lemma":"יָלִיד","tr":"ya·lid","gloss":"born","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":13},{"base":"H6946","lemma":"קָדֵשׁ","tr":"qa·desh","gloss":"Kadesh","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":18},{"base":"H7725","lemma":"שׁוּב","tr":"shuv","gloss":"to return: return","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":1057},{"base":"H5794","lemma":"עַז","tr":"az","gloss":"strong","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":24}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"EXO","chapter":3,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":9,"source":"both","text":"I have come down to rescue them from the hand of the Egyptians and to bring them up out of that land to a good and spacious land, a land flowing with milk and honey—the home of the Canaanites, Hittites, Amorites, Perizzites, Hivites, and Jebusites.","from":27},{"book":"EXO","chapter":3,"verse":17,"verseEnd":17,"votes":7,"source":"both","text":"And I have promised to bring you up out of your affliction in Egypt, into the land of the Canaanites, Hittites, Amorites, Perizzites, Hivites, and Jebusites—a land flowing with milk and honey.’","from":27},{"book":"DEU","chapter":1,"verse":28,"verseEnd":28,"votes":7,"source":"both","text":"Where can we go? Our brothers have made our hearts melt, saying: ‘The people are larger and taller than we are; the cities are large, with walls up to the heavens. We even saw the descendants of the Anakim there.’”","from":28},{"book":"DEU","chapter":9,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":7,"source":"openbible","text":"Hear, O Israel: Today you are about to cross the Jordan to go in and dispossess nations greater and stronger than you, with large cities fortified to the heavens.","from":28},{"book":"DEU","chapter":9,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":7,"source":"openbible","text":"The people are strong and tall, the descendants of the Anakim. You know about them, and you have heard it said, “Who can stand up to the sons of Anak?”","from":28},{"book":"EXO","chapter":13,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"And when the LORD brings you into the land of the Canaanites, Hittites, Amorites, Hivites, and Jebusites—the land He swore to your fathers that He would give you, a land flowing with milk and honey—you shall keep this service in this month.","from":27},{"book":"EXO","chapter":33,"verse":3,"verseEnd":3,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"Go up to a land flowing with milk and honey. But I will not go with you, because you are a stiff-necked people; otherwise, I might destroy you on the way.”","from":27},{"book":"NUM","chapter":32,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"This is what your fathers did when I sent them from Kadesh-barnea to inspect the land.","from":26}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"exodus-family","title":"Moses and his circle","people":2}]},"30-33":{"people":[{"id":"caleb-h3612g","name":"Caleb","kind":"person","brief":"Joshua's compatriot","count":1,"firstVerse":30},{"id":"moses-h4872","name":"Moses","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Amram","count":1,"firstVerse":30},{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":1,"firstVerse":32},{"id":"anak-h6061","name":"Anak","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Arba","count":1,"firstVerse":33},{"id":"nephilim-h5303","name":"Nephilim","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":33}],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"H5303","lemma":"נְפִלִים","tr":"ne·phil","gloss":"Nephilim","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":3},{"base":"H3201","lemma":"יָכֹל","tr":"ya·khol","gloss":"be able","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":194},{"base":"H5927","lemma":"עָלָה","tr":"a·lah","gloss":"to ascend: rise","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":889},{"base":"H8446","lemma":"תּוּר","tr":"tur","gloss":"to spy","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":24},{"base":"H9034","lemma":"הָ","tr":"ha","gloss":"her","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":490},{"base":"H2284","lemma":"חָגָב","tr":"cha·gav","gloss":"locust","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":5},{"base":"H0582","lemma":"אֱנוֹשׁ","tr":"e·nosh","gloss":"human","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":565},{"base":"H2013","lemma":"הַס","tr":"ha·sah","gloss":"to silence","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":8},{"base":"H1681","lemma":"דִּבָּה","tr":"dib·bah","gloss":"slander","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":9},{"base":"H6061","lemma":"עֲנָק","tr":"a·naq","gloss":"Anak","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":9}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"NUM","chapter":14,"verse":24,"verseEnd":24,"votes":9,"source":"both","text":"But because My servant Caleb has a different spirit and has followed Me wholeheartedly, I will bring him into the land he has entered, and his descendants will inherit it.","from":30},{"book":"DEU","chapter":1,"verse":28,"verseEnd":28,"votes":9,"source":"both","text":"Where can we go? Our brothers have made our hearts melt, saying: ‘The people are larger and taller than we are; the cities are large, with walls up to the heavens. We even saw the descendants of the Anakim there.’”","from":31},{"book":"DEU","chapter":1,"verse":28,"verseEnd":28,"votes":9,"source":"both","text":"Where can we go? Our brothers have made our hearts melt, saying: ‘The people are larger and taller than we are; the cities are large, with walls up to the heavens. We even saw the descendants of the Anakim there.’”","from":33},{"book":"ROM","chapter":8,"verse":31,"verseEnd":31,"votes":9,"source":"both","text":"What then shall we say in response to these things? If God is for us, who can be against us?","from":30},{"book":"JOS","chapter":14,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":8,"source":"both","text":"Although my brothers who went with me made the hearts of the people melt with fear, I remained loyal to the LORD my God.","from":31},{"book":"PHP","chapter":4,"verse":13,"verseEnd":13,"votes":8,"source":"both","text":"I can do all things through Christ who gives me strength.","from":30},{"book":"PSA","chapter":60,"verse":12,"verseEnd":12,"votes":7,"source":"both","text":"With God we will perform with valor, and He will trample our enemies.","from":30},{"book":"ISA","chapter":40,"verse":22,"verseEnd":22,"votes":7,"source":"both","text":"He sits enthroned above the circle of the earth; its dwellers are like grasshoppers. He stretches out the heavens like a curtain, and spreads them out like a tent to dwell in.","from":33}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"exodus-family","title":"Moses and his circle","people":2}]}}